;PALASM Design Description
; pds2v test: logic allocator.  M1 needs 12 product terms = 3 clusters, which
; must be C0..C2; M0 can only use C0 or C1, so block A is one cluster short.
; EXPECT-EXIT: 1
; EXPECT: warning: BIG12 needs 12 product terms
; EXPECT: error: block A: the logic allocator is 1 cluster(s) short
; EXPECT: clusters needed: M0(SMALL)=1 M1(BIG12)=3

CHIP     BADCL  MACH111
PIN  10  A
PIN  11  B
PIN  13  C
PIN  32  D
PIN  33  E
PIN  35  F
PIN  24  G
PIN  25  H
PIN  26  I
PIN  27  J
PIN  28  K
PIN  29  L
PIN  2   SMALL  COMBINATORIAL   ; M0 of block A
PIN  3   BIG12  COMBINATORIAL   ; M1 of block A

EQUATIONS
SMALL = A * B
BIG12 = (A :+: B :+: C :+: D)   ; 8 product terms
      + E * F + G * H + I * J + K * L
